<title>SPAIN: Spain says EMU delay politically impossible.</title>
<headline>Spain says EMU delay politically impossible.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spain's Economy Secretary Cristobal Montoro said on Tuesday that a delay in European economic and monetary union (EMU) would be impossible.</p>
<p>&quot;Nobody in Europe intends to delay EMU. The euro has a calendar that no-one has questioned and furthermore its delay would be politically impossible,&quot; Montoro told a press conference.</p>
</text>
